== Evolution ==

=== Fossil history ===

[[File:Abies milleri SR 87-52-02 A.jpg|thumb|[[Fossil]] ''[[Abies milleri]]'' foliage and axis. [[Ypresian|Early Eocene]], 49.5 mya]]

The oldest pollen assignable to the genus dates to the [[Late Cretaceous]] in [[Siberia]], with records of leaves and reproductive organs across the Northern Hemisphere from the [[Eocene]] onwards.<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Xiang |first1=Xiaoguo |last2=Cao |first2=Ming |last3=Zhou |first3=Zhekun |date=October 2007 |title=Fossil history and modern distribution of the genus Abies (Pinaceae) |url=http://link.springer.com/10.1007/s11461-007-0058-4 |journal=Frontiers of Forestry in China |language=en |volume=2 |issue=4 |pages=355–365 |doi=10.1007/s11461-007-0058-4 |access-date=2023-02-15 |archive-date=2024-01-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240101153338/https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11461-007-0058-4 |url-status=live |url-access=subscription }}</ref>

