=== Pests and diseases ===

Firs are hosts to a variety of invertebrate pests and fungal diseases. Pest groups include [[Adelgidae|adelgid]] bugs, [[aphid]]s, [[bark beetle]]s, [[clearwing moth]]s, [[Pissodes|conifer twig weevils]], [[caterpillar]]s of some moths, [[nematode]]s, [[sawflies]], [[spider mite]]s, and [[spittlebug]]s. Diseases of firs include annosus (''[[Heterobasidion]]'') [[root rot]], [[canker]]s, and [[needle cast]].<ref name="UC IPM">{{cite web |title=Pests in Gardens and Landscapes |url=https://ipm.ucanr.edu/PMG/GARDEN/PLANTS/fir.html |publisher=University of California Agriculture & Natural Resources: Statewide Integrated Pest Management Program |access-date=10 September 2025}}</ref>

